# 14. DevOps Function Example ⭐⭐⭐

A practical service-check script:

```bash
#!/bin/bash

set -euo pipefail

check_service() {
    local service="$1"

    if systemctl is-active --quiet "$service"; then
        echo "$service: RUNNING"
    else
        echo "$service: NOT RUNNING"
        return 1
    fi
}

main() {
    check_service nginx
    check_service ssh
}

main
```

This demonstrates almost everything from Day 18:

```text
Strict Mode
    ↓
Function
    ↓
Local Variable
    ↓
Function Argument
    ↓
Condition
    ↓
systemctl
    ↓
Return Status
```

